<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay's inflation 0.2 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Paraguay's inflation 0.2 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's inflation was 0.2 percent in April, down from 2.5 percent in March and 0.6 percent in April 1996, the Central Bank said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Inflation in the January-April period was 5.5 percent, down from 5.6 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>In the 12 months to April, prices rose 8.1 percent, down from 10.9 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>((--Daniela Desantis, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8))</p>
